   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Higgins",
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Brian_Higgins#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "He served as the 145th district representative to the New York State Assembly from 1999 to 2004.",
